      "args": {
        "pin": "000000_WRONG_EDGE"
      },
      "expect": "ok",
      "source": "regression",
      "bug": "Smoke 5.5.3 used legacy conf.pos_manager_pin; hashed admin PIN settings are the source of truth via _pin_configured()",
      "note": "When PIN configured, response must include pin_configured and authorized=false for wrong pin — checked in smoke; here only no-crash"
    },
